#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:114
msgid "MNA — nutritional status"
msgstr "MNA — voedingstoestand"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:116
msgid ""
"Menu: **Nursing Care → Evaluation Tools**, then **MNA (Nutritional "
"Assessment)**."
msgstr ""
"Menu: **Zorg → Evaluatiehulpmiddelen**, en dan **MNA "
"(voedingsbeoordeling)**."

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:118
msgid ""
"The **MNA** short form screens for **malnutrition** out of **14 points**, "
"from 6 questions: reduced food intake over 3 months (0–2), recent weight "
"loss (0–3), mobility (0–2), acute illness or psychological stress (0 or 2), "
"neuropsychological problems (0–2) and body mass index (0–3)."
msgstr ""
"De korte vorm van de **MNA** screent op **ondervoeding** op **14 punten**, "
"aan de hand van 6 vragen: verminderde voedselinname over 3 maanden (0–2), "
"recent gewichtsverlies (0–3), mobiliteit (0–2), acute ziekte of "
"psychologische stress (0 of 2), neuropsychologische problemen (0–2) en body-"
"mass-index (0–3)."

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:65
msgid "12–14"
msgstr "12–14"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:65
msgid "8–11"
msgstr "8–11"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:65
msgid "At risk of malnutrition"
msgstr "Risico op ondervoeding"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:65
msgid "0–7"
msgstr "0–7"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:65
msgid "Malnourished"
msgstr "Ondervoed"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:129
msgid "Nutritional follow-up"
msgstr "Voedingsopvolging"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:132
msgid ""
"Weight, intake and hydration follow-up are part of the care and meals apps —"
" see [The clinical registers](../soins/registres.md) and [Nutritional "
"follow-up](../repas/suivi-nutritionnel.md)."
msgstr ""
"De opvolging van gewicht, inname en hydratatie hoort bij de zorg- en "
"maaltijdapps — zie [Klinische registers](../soins/registres.md) en "
"[Nutritionele opvolging en ondervoeding](../repas/suivi-nutritionnel.md)."

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:137
msgid "OHAT — oral health"
msgstr "OHAT — mondgezondheid"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:139
msgid ""
"Menu: **Nursing Care → Evaluation Tools**, then **OHAT (Oral Health)**."
msgstr ""
"Menu: **Zorg → Evaluatiehulpmiddelen**, en dan **OHAT (mondgezondheid)**."

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:141
msgid ""
"The **OHAT** scores **8 categories** from 0 (healthy) to 2 (needs "
"treatment): lips, tongue, gums and tissues, saliva, natural teeth, dentures,"
" oral cleanliness and dental pain. The total runs from 0 to 16. **The higher"
" the score, the more concerning the situation.**"
msgstr ""
"De **OHAT** scoort **8 categorieën** van 0 (gezond) tot 2 (te behandelen): "
"lippen, tong, tandvlees en weefsels, speeksel, natuurlijke tanden, "
"kunstgebit, mondhygiëne en tandpijn. Het totaal loopt van 0 tot 16. **Hoe "
"hoger de score, hoe zorgwekkender de situatie.**"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:129
msgid "0–3"
msgstr "0–3"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:129
msgid "Healthy"
msgstr "Gezond"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:129
msgid "4–8"
msgstr "4–8"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:129
msgid "Changes needed (refer to a dental professional)"
msgstr "Aanpassingen nodig (verwijzen naar een tandheelkundige)"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:129
msgid "9–16"
msgstr "9–16"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:129
msgid "Unhealthy (urgent referral)"
msgstr "Ongezond (dringende verwijzing)"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:152
#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:170
msgid "Note"
msgstr "Opmerking"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:153
msgid ""
"**Natural teeth** and **Dentures** offer **N/A** (not applicable), which is "
"left out of the total."
msgstr ""
"**Natuurlijke tanden** en **Kunstgebit** bieden **N/A** (niet van "
"toepassing), dat buiten het totaal blijft."

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:157
msgid "Tinetti — balance, gait and fall risk"
msgstr "Tinetti — evenwicht, gang en valrisico"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:159
msgid ""
"Menu: **Nursing Care → Evaluation Tools**, then **Tinetti (Balance & "
"Gait)**."
msgstr ""
"Menu: **Zorg → Evaluatiehulpmiddelen**, en dan **Tinetti (Balans & "
"Gangwerk)**."

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:161
msgid ""
"The **Tinetti** scale assesses **balance** (9 items, /16) and **gait** "
"(/12), for a total out of **28**. Resthome computes both subscores and the "
"total."
msgstr ""
"De **Tinetti**-schaal beoordeelt het **evenwicht** (9 items, /16) en de "
"**gang** (/12), voor een totaal op **28**. Resthome berekent beide subscores"
" en het totaal."

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:152
msgid "Fall risk"
msgstr "Valrisico"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:152
msgid "25–28"
msgstr "25–28"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:152
msgid "Low risk"
msgstr "Laag risico"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:152
msgid "19–24"
msgstr "19–24"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:152
msgid "Under 19"
msgstr "Minder dan 19"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:171
msgid ""
"The **Morse** fall-risk scale and the **falls register** are in the "
"[clinical registers](../soins/registres.md)."
msgstr ""
"De valrisicoschaal van **Morse** en het **valregister** staan in de "
"[klinische registers](../soins/registres.md)."

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:175
msgid "Pain — EVA or DOLOPLUS-2"
msgstr "Pijn — VAS of DOLOPLUS-2"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:177
msgid ""
"Menu: **Nursing Care → Evaluation Tools**, then **Pain (EVA / DOLOPLUS-2)**."
msgstr ""
"Menu: **Zorg → Evaluatiehulpmiddelen**, en dan **Pijn (VAS / DOLOPLUS-2)**."

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:179
msgid "Choose the **Scale**:"
msgstr "Kies de **Schaal**:"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:181
msgid "**EVA (self-reported)** — the resident gives a score from 0 to 10;"
msgstr "**VAS (zelfevaluatie)** — de bewoner geeft een score van 0 tot 10;"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:182
msgid ""
"**DOLOPLUS-2 (observed)** — for a resident who cannot say it, the team "
"scores 10 behaviours from 0 to 3, for a total out of 30: **Somatic "
"Complaints**, **Protective Posture at Rest**, **Protection of Painful "
"Areas**, **Facial Expression**, **Sleep**, **Washing / Dressing**, "
"**Mobility**, **Communication**, **Social Life** and **Behaviour Problems**."
msgstr ""
"**DOLOPLUS-2 (hetero-evaluatie)** — voor een bewoner die het niet kan "
"zeggen, scoort het team 10 gedragingen van 0 tot 3, voor een totaal op 30: "
"**Somatische klachten**, **Antalgische houding in rust**, **Bescherming van "
"pijnlijke zones**, **Gelaatsuitdrukking**, **Slaap**, **Wassen / "
"aankleden**, **Mobiliteit**, **Communicatie**, **Sociaal leven** en "
"**Gedragsstoornissen**."

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:170
msgid "Pain level"
msgstr "Pijnniveau"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:170
msgid "EVA (/10)"
msgstr "VAS (/10)"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:170
msgid "DOLOPLUS-2 (/30)"
msgstr "DOLOPLUS-2 (/30)"

